{"unit_id":"NoelJudeNoel__dshost-plugin#feature-1","repo":"NoelJudeNoel/dshost-plugin","commit":"16cb1885345f84f2e0b18f550be353f622d9c86d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dshost-plugin** 的功能「远程访问 DSH Web」：通过 WebSocket 中继连接本地 DSH，并把浏览器的 HTTP 请求代理到本机 Web 服务。插件启动后自动连接，远程请求会收到本地响应。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-47","agent/core.js:875-899","agent/core.js:1175-1212"]}
{"unit_id":"NoelJudeNoel__dshost-plugin#feature-2","repo":"NoelJudeNoel/dshost-plugin","commit":"16cb1885345f84f2e0b18f550be353f622d9c86d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dshost-plugin** 的功能「代理工作区服务」：把 cordis 配置中的服务清单发送到中继，并按服务目标转发 HTTP 与 WebSocket 流量。服务由用户配置，实例注册后上报清单。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-24","agent/core.js:715-727","agent/core.js:1175-1181","agent/core.js:1306-1335"]}
